{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Cosy Haven</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build </strong>and <strong>decorate </strong>your tavern, <strong>hire </strong>staff, <strong>stock </strong>your larder, <strong>meet </strong>the locals, <strong>be the boss</strong> and run the show! Whether you keep a cosy neighbourhood taphouse or a lean, mean gold-minting machine, the choices - and consequences - are yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/409de55ef43fd0641b8245dc4cd86803.poster.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/409de55ef43fd0641b8245dc4cd86803.webm?t=1775082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaos Comes Knocking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of <strong>intertwined game systems</strong> create unpredictable<strong> emergent situations</strong>. Dirt, heat, noise, flammability, sickness and of course, a parade of colourful customers all keep the unexpected coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/a91df4603d6c258095d084450a577aad.poster.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/a91df4603d6c258095d084450a577aad.webm?t=1775082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Today\u2019s situation:</strong> Half of your staff are in bed with sleep-sickness. Orders are piling up and patrons\u2019 tempers are getting heated. So is the tavern - because it\u2019s on fire! A spark from a broken lantern landed on just the wrong patch of dirt with no one around to notice. Oops, perhaps it\u2019s time to call the fire brigade...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Unusual Journey Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An<strong> expansive narrative campaign</strong> lets you build taverns across a <strong>vibrant world</strong> full of your favourite fantasy cultures. Each new location brings <strong>fresh challenges</strong> and <strong>surprising stories</strong>. Meet immortal elementals, outwit halfling philosophers and aid a crazed orc inventor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/54c11bc11de6a33a6e34a7c1259e2c5c.poster.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/54c11bc11de6a33a6e34a7c1259e2c5c.webm?t=1775082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Witty RPG Full of Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>magical storybook </strong>fully-narrated by  <strong>Steven Pacey</strong>. Encounter hundreds of bite-sized stories with a surprise at every turn. There\u2019s always someone needing the guidance of a Tavern Keeper like you. What <strong>choices </strong>will you make?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/bf41a2215aee5ba24230be68ef3d86b3.poster.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/bf41a2215aee5ba24230be68ef3d86b3.webm?t=1775082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design Mode - Get Inn-Spired</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate </strong>every nook and hollow of your tavern to create everything from bustling taprooms to relaxing reading corners. Place and manipulate <strong>thousands of items</strong> anywhere with <strong>complete creative freedom </strong>and make the tavern of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/759ec41d36112898aaf164abd25fc594.poster.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/759ec41d36112898aaf164abd25fc594.webm?t=1775082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Own Item Workshop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond decorating and become a master artisan by using Tavern Keeper\u2019s powerful <strong>Design Mode</strong> to craft unique furnishings. <strong>Combine </strong>pieces, <strong>add </strong>magical effects, then <strong>share your creations</strong> with the Tavern Keeper community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/b732f88447033f535026c5a4e7cbdae4.poster.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/b732f88447033f535026c5a4e7cbdae4.webm?t=1775082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Game, Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the single-player campaign your way with <strong>adjustable game mechanics</strong> and <strong>storyteller settings</strong> or play in <strong>Freeplay </strong>for a custom challenge. Pick <strong>Challenging </strong>and strategize over every decision, barely making it through each day, or play a <strong>Relaxed </strong>game running the tavern of your dreams without pressure. The choice is yours.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/bb546c55f46e994eca4384bf3b2134af.poster.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/bb546c55f46e994eca4384bf3b2134af.webm?t=1775082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our Love Letter to Management Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by Greenheart Games \ud83d\udc9a (Game Dev Tycoon), a <strong>tiny independent team</strong>, Tavern Keeper is a <strong>passion project</strong> more than a decade in the making. Every detail is <strong>handcrafted</strong>, from the art, sound, writing, animations, down to the <strong>3D user interface</strong> and many <strong>quality-of-life features</strong>. We took no shortcuts to bring you <strong>an experience like no other</strong>. Come on Inn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/faa7639d775f10def7e5a2d5297d29be.webp?t=1775082914\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"15 Minutes of Fame","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/436780/6db87322132372eec6b6bf67d436a64aaf9369f4.jpg"},{"name":"Rebel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/436780/ed754da6189d3267ff24312093e66b06bdd1fc44.jpg"},{"name":"Let It Burn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/436780/2911db18b6719f0983f0bb41df6dcfb55d04c173.jpg"},{"name":"Let\u2019s See Some ID","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/436780/a79770b9c8f2cd5fba111a2a7a70409093c2eca9.jpg"},{"name":"Heartless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/436780/3c21a73477acdbbb2a2292d2c8020aed16d10d1f.jpg"},{"name":"Promoter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/436780/6832eb3e0e00e7f11d5d81cb17058982f05d9873.jpg"},{"name":"Time Traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/436780/6133a4aafea592eb50e44e51af0dbfddc730434f.jpg"},{"name":"Damage Control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/436780/1e2160a04a68a0af21ee9daf047f4784be105e71.jpg"},{"name":"Kingmaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/436780/0399ecbbf1664403895ec419974913f5757eb081.jpg"},{"name":"Fire In The Hole","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/436780/5dcad69aa36580bbb6a590165b1fadaf582a8481.jpg"}],"total":52},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/436780?t=1775082914","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1775082914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/ce5a851d599448045cb5439b223ff89f24248465/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775082914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/ce5a851d599448045cb5439b223ff89f24248465/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775082914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/d9f47bcb8316f47ad12d2b0c4171228f.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1327 height=8192 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Cosy Haven</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build </strong>and <strong>decorate </strong>your tavern, <strong>hire </strong>staff, <strong>stock </strong>your larder, <strong>meet </strong>the locals, <strong>be the boss</strong> and run the show! Whether you keep a cosy neighbourhood taphouse or a lean, mean gold-minting machine, the choices - and consequences - are yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/409de55ef43fd0641b8245dc4cd86803.poster.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/409de55ef43fd0641b8245dc4cd86803.webm?t=1775082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaos Comes Knocking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of <strong>intertwined game systems</strong> create unpredictable<strong> emergent situations</strong>. Dirt, heat, noise, flammability, sickness and of course, a parade of colourful customers all keep the unexpected coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/a91df4603d6c258095d084450a577aad.poster.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/a91df4603d6c258095d084450a577aad.webm?t=1775082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Today\u2019s situation:</strong> Half of your staff are in bed with sleep-sickness. Orders are piling up and patrons\u2019 tempers are getting heated. So is the tavern - because it\u2019s on fire! A spark from a broken lantern landed on just the wrong patch of dirt with no one around to notice. Oops, perhaps it\u2019s time to call the fire brigade...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Unusual Journey Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An<strong> expansive narrative campaign</strong> lets you build taverns across a <strong>vibrant world</strong> full of your favourite fantasy cultures. Each new location brings <strong>fresh challenges</strong> and <strong>surprising stories</strong>. Meet immortal elementals, outwit halfling philosophers and aid a crazed orc inventor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/54c11bc11de6a33a6e34a7c1259e2c5c.poster.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/54c11bc11de6a33a6e34a7c1259e2c5c.webm?t=1775082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Witty RPG Full of Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>magical storybook </strong>fully-narrated by  <strong>Steven Pacey</strong>. Encounter hundreds of bite-sized stories with a surprise at every turn. There\u2019s always someone needing the guidance of a Tavern Keeper like you. What <strong>choices </strong>will you make?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/bf41a2215aee5ba24230be68ef3d86b3.poster.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/bf41a2215aee5ba24230be68ef3d86b3.webm?t=1775082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design Mode - Get Inn-Spired</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate </strong>every nook and hollow of your tavern to create everything from bustling taprooms to relaxing reading corners. Place and manipulate <strong>thousands of items</strong> anywhere with <strong>complete creative freedom </strong>and make the tavern of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/759ec41d36112898aaf164abd25fc594.poster.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/759ec41d36112898aaf164abd25fc594.webm?t=1775082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Own Item Workshop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond decorating and become a master artisan by using Tavern Keeper\u2019s powerful <strong>Design Mode</strong> to craft unique furnishings. <strong>Combine </strong>pieces, <strong>add </strong>magical effects, then <strong>share your creations</strong> with the Tavern Keeper community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/b732f88447033f535026c5a4e7cbdae4.poster.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/b732f88447033f535026c5a4e7cbdae4.webm?t=1775082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Game, Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the single-player campaign your way with <strong>adjustable game mechanics</strong> and <strong>storyteller settings</strong> or play in <strong>Freeplay </strong>for a custom challenge. Pick <strong>Challenging </strong>and strategize over every decision, barely making it through each day, or play a <strong>Relaxed </strong>game running the tavern of your dreams without pressure. The choice is yours.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/bb546c55f46e994eca4384bf3b2134af.poster.avif?t=1775082914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/bb546c55f46e994eca4384bf3b2134af.webm?t=1775082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our Love Letter to Management Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by Greenheart Games \ud83d\udc9a (Game Dev Tycoon), a <strong>tiny independent team</strong>, Tavern Keeper is a <strong>passion project</strong> more than a decade in the making. Every detail 